    These results, particularly the slight decrease in performance from both tuning and increased LSTM size, highlight the robustness of the `CustomCNNLSTM` architecture with its initial parameters (Evaluation ID 14: score 0.462). It seems that simply expanding components might not be the most effective path forward without deeper structural changes or algorithmic shifts.


