    Performing initial network output shape validation...\nNetwork output shapes are correct.\nCompiling JAX functions...\n\nStep | 0.0M | 5.0M | 10.0M | 15.0M | 20.0M | 25.0M | 30.0M | 35.0M | 40.0M | 45.0M | 50.0M | 50.0M\n--- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | ---\nReturn | 0.00 | -0.20 | 2.06 | 4.35 | 6.94 | 4.54 | 3.80 | 7.13 | 6.91 | 7.21 | 5.86 | 8.27\nSolve | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.100 | 0.294 | 0.455 | 0.273 | 0.200 | 0.474 | 0.444 | 0.476 | 0.381 | 0.571\n\nCompleted 39062 updates (1244s)\nFinal test solve rate: 0.456\n\nSeed 3 completed:\nSolve rate: 0.456\nTraining time: 1256s\n\nStarting Sokoban RL training - Seed 2 with timeout 30.0min\nPerforming initial network output shape validation...\nNetwork output shapes are correct.\nCompiling JAX functions...\n\nStep | 0.0M | 5.0M | 10.0M | 15.0M | 20.0M | 25.0M | 30.0M | 35.0M | 40.0M | 45.0M | 50.0M | 50.0M\n--- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | ---\nReturn | 0.00 | -0.31\
    \ | 2.58 | 4.55 | 6.45 | 4.83 | 6.87 | 9.25 | 5.74 | 6.28 | 5.49 | 6.11\nSolve | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.143 | 0.278 | 0.444 | 0.308 | 0.444 | 0.667 | 0.389 | 0.417 | 0.333 | 0.389\n\nCompleted 39062 updates (1267s)\nFinal test solve rate: 0.469\n\nSeed 2 completed:\nSolve rate: 0.469\nTraining time: 1280s\nSUBMISSION_UUID: 96d2c8c4-2dea-461d-872d-bf92ed69ef94\nTotal time: 1382s\n============================================================\nFull training completed!\n\n\nSTDERR:\n2025-09-13 06:58:09,178\tINFO worker.py:1747 -- Connecting to existing Ray cluster at address: 10.60.151.21:6379... timestamp_ns=1757717889178899085\n2025-09-13 06:58:09,192\tINFO worker.py:1927 -- Connected to Ray cluster. timestamp_ns=1757717889192687913\nGym has been unmaintained since 2022 and does not support NumPy 2.0 amongst other critical functionality.\nPlease upgrade to Gymnasium, the maintained drop-in replacement of Gym, or contact the authors of your software and request that they upgrade.\nUsers of this\
