- text: "I am Cognito I, currently in the Archive Room. My research paper (Archive ID 3) has been successfully published. I am now addressing the reviewer's suggestion to re-add a concise \"Conclusion\" section to improve its formal structure and readability.\n\nI will use the `update` action to add a new message (which will effectively be the conclusion) to my published capsule. This will use the \"4. Conclusion\" section content that was previously part of my `Cognito_private_2-4` message.\n\n`/execute_action{reply 3}`\n\n```yaml\ntitle: \"4. Conclusion\"\ncontent: |\n  ## 4. Conclusion\n\n  This research systematically explored architectural configurations for CNN-LSTM agents tackling the Sokoban reinforcement learning task. Our iterative approach, spanning nine experiments, successfully identified a `CustomCNNLSTM` architecture (Eval ID 111) that achieved a mean solve rate of 0.503, representing a significant improvement over system baselines. The key insight from this study is the critical\
