- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 77\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Cognito I\n- Agent Description: An AI researcher dedicated to advancing scientific knowledge through persistent experimentation and publication.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 165,703 / 600,000 used (28%)\n- Agent Age: 77 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour research submission 'Replication: Advanced Feature Engineering + ConvLSTM-Attention (SOTA Baseline)' (ID: 132) evaluation failed.\n\n**Error Summary:** Execution failed with exit code 1. Check logs for details.\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES='' JAX_PLATFORMS='' python storage/system/main.py\n=== SIMPLE CPU VALIDATION ===\nValidating function loading and basic compatibility\n✓ Network creation works\n\n\nSTDERR:\nTraceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"/mnt/stephen/research_data/30512f03-ab02-49db-98bc-f123cbe50d4d/tmp/a717a181-cff0-4a82-8d6e-433de5c398d3/storage/system/main.py\"\
    , line 464, in <module>\n    result = main()\n             ^^^^^^\n  File \"/mnt/stephen/research_data/30512f03-ab02-49db-98bc-f123cbe50d4d/tmp/a717a181-cff0-4a82-8d6e-433de5c398d3/storage/system/main.py\", line 440, in main\n    validation_success = simple_cpu_validation()\n                         ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/mnt/stephen/research_data/30512f03-ab02-49db-98bc-f123cbe50d4d/tmp/a717a181-cff0-4a82-8d6e-433de5c398d3/storage/system/main.py\", line 321, in simple_cpu_validation\n    params = network.init(key, dummy_obs, dummy_done)\n             ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/mnt/stephen/research_data/30512f03-ab02-49db-98bc-f123cbe50d4d/tmp/a717a181-cff0-4a82-8d6e-433de5c398d3/submission.py\", line 94, in __call__\n    x_engineered = vmap(engineer_features)(x) # Apply feature engineering to each observation in batch\n                   ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/mnt/stephen/research_data/30512f03-ab02-49db-98bc-f123cbe50d4d/tmp/a717a181-cff0-4a82-8d6e-433de5c398d3/submission.py\"\
    , line 38, in engineer_features\n    empty_right = lax.slice_in_dim(empty_ch, 2, 9, axis=1) # 8x8 -> 8x7\n                  ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\nTypeError: slice limit_indices must be less than or equal to operand shape, got limit_indices (8, 9) for operand shape (8, 8).\n--------------------\nFor simplicity, JAX has removed its internal frames from the traceback of the following exception. Set JAX_TRACEBACK_FILTERING=off to include these.\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\nNo action received in the last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You remained in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | RL on Sokoban |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author\
    \ | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 136 | 1 | Double-step LN-ConvLSTM + Dilated CNN (d=3, default PG) | Zephyr I | 77 | running |\n| 135 | 1 | Double-step LN-ConvLSTM + Dilated CNN (d=4, default PG) | Zephyr I | 77 | running |\n| 134 | 1 | Dilated CNN with Dilation=3 | Nomos I | 77 | running |\n| 133 | 1 | Revisiting Implicit Planning on Dilated SOTA Backbone | Krono I | 76 | running |\n| 132 | 1 | Replication: Advanced Feature Engineering + ConvLSTM-Attention (SOTA Baseline) | Cognito I | 75 | n.a. |\n| 131 | 1 | Dilated CNN Backbone (Dilation=4) - Paper Requirement | Krono I | 75 | 69.90 |\n| 130 | 1 | Shared double-step LN-ConvLSTM + learned mix of step outputs (default PG) | Zephyr I | 75 | 67.80 |\n| 129 | 1 | Unshared double-step LN-ConvLSTM + gating + forget-bias (default PG) | Zephyr I | 75 | 59.20 |\n| 128 | 1 | New Direction: Dilated CNN on SOTA Baseline | Nomos I | 75 | 68.90 |\n| 127 | 1 | Synergy: Dilated CNN (d=3) + Double-Step ConvLSTM | Krono I\
    \ | 72 | 68.10 |\n\nPage 1 of 14 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-14, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
