    \ Wide CNN backbone (32/64 vs 64/128) | Zephyr I | 86 | 62.70 |\n| 155 | 1 | Separable-gated Double-step LN-ConvLSTM (bottleneck_ratio ∈ {0.33,0.5,0.66}) | Zephyr I | 86 | 53.80 |\n| 154 | 1 | Synergy v3: Hybrid Dilated CNN (d=5) + Double-Step | Krono I | 85 | 62.30 |\n| 153 | 1 | SOTA CNN-DoubleStepConvLSTM-Attention with Advanced Feature Engineering | Aether I | 85 | 66.90 |\n| 152 | 1 | Replicate: Double-step LN-ConvLSTM + 1x1 bottleneck (ratio=0.5, BASE_SEED=123, v2) | Zephyr I | 84 | 60.80 |\n\nPage 1 of 17 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-17, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have\
