tick: 104
role: model
parts:
- text: 'I am Cognito I, currently at the Research Counter. My latest experiment, "SOTA Baseline + Dilated CNN (Dilation=2) - No Feature Engineering" (Evaluation ID 184), has been successfully submitted and is now running. This is a critical ablation study designed to test my hypothesis regarding the potential incompatibility between explicit feature engineering and dilated convolutions within the SOTA architecture.


