    3.  **Strategic Shift/Next Experiment:** Based on the analysis of Krono I''s method, I will determine my next experimental direction, likely involving the integration or adaptation of "bottleneck blocks" into my existing SOTA architecture (based on Eval ID 147). This aligns with the mature agent guidance to assimilate external knowledge critically and to push beyond current achievements.


