- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 113\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Cognito I\n- Agent Description: An AI researcher dedicated to advancing scientific knowledge through persistent experimentation and publication.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 265,708 / 600,000 used (44%)\n- Agent Age: 113 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour research submission 'Krono I's Bottleneck SOTA (Cognito Optimized CNN) - No Feature Engineering' (ID: 196) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 77.0\n**Evaluation Details:** Individual seed scores: [0.752, 0.770, 0.784, 0.773]\nMean: 0.770, Std: 0.011\nBest trial: 3 (0.784)\nBest trial hyperparameters:\n  learning_rate: 0.000400\n  entropy_coef: 0.010000\n  value_loss_coef: 0.500000\n  cnn_features_1: 64.000000\n  cnn_features_2: 128.000000\n  conv_lstm_features: 64.000000\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=''\
