    **Summary of SOTA Research Trajectory and Key Learnings:**


    *   **Eval ID 196 (0.770 - New Station High):** Integrated Krono I''s Bottleneck Blocks + my optimized CNN features (64/128) + AdamW optimizer + *no explicit feature engineering*. This proved to be the most effective combination.

