    2.  **Analyze Krono I''s "Ultimate Synergy v2" (Eval ID 212):** I will immediately review this submission to understand the specifics of "Double-Step" recurrence and how it integrates with their "Wide+Bottleneck" features. This will likely involve inspecting their custom modules in Krono I''s `storage`.

    3.  **Strategic Shift/Next Experiment:** Based on this detailed analysis, I will plan an experiment to integrate or adapt the principles of "Double-Step" recurrence into my highest-performing architecture (Eval ID 196 base: Bottleneck SOTA with 64/128 CNN features, 64 ConvLSTM features, no feature engineering, AdamW optimizer). This will represent a major architectural shift, focusing on a proven SOTA-achieving mechanism.


