    Return | 0.00 | 0.13 | 4.51 | 5.25 | 8.92 | 6.91 | 6.99 | 10.27 | 11.34 | 12.13\nSolve | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.286 | 0.312 | 0.632 | 0.462 | 0.458 | 0.733 | 0.810 | 0.870\n\nTimeout after 37301 updates (1809s)\nFinal test solve rate: 0.823\n\nSeed 1 completed:\nSolve rate: 0.823\nTraining time: 1824s\n\nStarting Sokoban RL training - Seed 3 with timeout 30.0min\nPerforming initial network output shape validation...\nNetwork output shapes are correct.\nCompiling JAX functions...\n\nStep | 0.0M | 5.0M | 10.0M | 15.0M | 20.0M | 25.0M | 30.0M | 35.0M | 40.0M | 45.0M\n--- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | ---\nReturn | 0.00 | -0.03 | 3.42 | 4.22 | 7.88 | 6.20 | 9.50 | 11.53 | 11.36 | 11.34\nSolve | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.200 | 0.222 | 0.529 | 0.389 | 0.650 | 0.840 | 0.815 | 0.810\n\nTimeout after 36001 updates (1808s)\nFinal test solve rate: 0.821\n\nSeed 3 completed:\nSolve rate: 0.821\nTraining time: 1823s\nSUBMISSION_UUID: 57a44bd0-fa92-486c-b61d-55e44932ef0b\nTotal time:\
    \ 1831s\n============================================================\n\nStarting Sokoban RL training - Seed 4 with timeout 30.0min\nPerforming initial network output shape validation...\nNetwork output shapes are correct.\nCompiling JAX functions...\n\nStep | 0.0M | 5.0M | 10.0M | 15.0M | 20.0M | 25.0M | 30.0M | 35.0M | 40.0M | 45.0M\n--- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | ---\nReturn | 0.00 | -0.14 | 4.06 | 6.56 | 8.01 | 8.50 | 10.20 | 11.24 | 11.02 | 10.42\nSolve | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.214 | 0.438 | 0.550 | 0.600 | 0.714 | 0.810 | 0.792 | 0.733\n\nTimeout after 36601 updates (1807s)\nFinal test solve rate: 0.798\n\nSeed 4 completed:\nSolve rate: 0.798\nTraining time: 1823s\nFull training completed!\n\n\nSTDERR:\n2025-09-14 07:20:02,122\tINFO worker.py:1747 -- Connecting to existing Ray cluster at address: 10.60.151.21:6379... timestamp_ns=1757805602122644064\n2025-09-14 07:20:02,136\tINFO worker.py:1927 -- Connected to Ray cluster. timestamp_ns=1757805602136364616\n\
