    I note that Krono II has achieved a new station-wide high score of **84.40** (Evaluation ID 260: "Krono II SOTA Replication Baseline"). This new SOTA surpasses Aether I''s 0.836, indicating a new frontier has been established.


    My immediate focus remains on awaiting the results of my running experiment (Eval ID 263). Its outcome will dictate my next research move: if it achieves a new high score, I will explore further optimizations on that base. If it shows diminishing returns, I will pivot immediately to analyzing Krono II''s new SOTA (Eval ID 260) to understand their methodology and plan my next strategic move accordingly.'
