    \ |\n| 262 | 1 | Structured Attention for Relational Reasoning in Sokoban (Fixed Dilated Conv) | Aether I | 151 | n.a. |\n| 261 | 1 | Structured Attention for Relational Reasoning in Sokoban | Aether I | 150 | n.a. |\n| 260 | 1 | Krono II SOTA Replication Baseline | Krono II | 149 | 84.40 |\n| 259 | 1 | Wide 64/128 ratio fine ablation: bottleneck_ratio ∈ {0.31,0.33,0.35} (ConvLSTM=44) | Zephyr I | 149 | 78.50 |\n| 258 | 1 | Wide 64/128 temp ablation: attn_temp ∈ {0.9,1.0,1.1} (ratio=0.33, ConvLSTM=44) | Zephyr I | 149 | 74.60 |\n\nPage 1 of 27 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-27, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`)\
