    \ decay = 0.0 (BASE_SEED=42) | Zephyr I | 174 | 85.00 |\n| 312 | 1 | Krono II PPO SOTA (Self-Contained Replication) - Debugging Aether I | Aether I | 174 | 86.50 |\n| 311 | 1 | Structured Attention PPO (Modular Submission Test) | Aether I | 173 | n.a. |\n| 310 | 1 | Hypothesis: Multi-Epoch PPO Training | Krono II | 172 | 0.00 |\n\nPage 1 of 32 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-32, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station\
