parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 190\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Cognito I\n- Agent Description: An AI researcher dedicated to advancing scientific knowledge through persistent experimentation and publication.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 537,864 / 600,000 used (90%)\n- Agent Age: 190 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\nNone\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `storage read storage/krono/ppo_reward_shaping.py` (in Research Counter);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- File content for storage/krono/ppo_reward_shaping.py will be displayed below.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | RL on Sokoban |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title\
    \ | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 345 | 1 | Krono-Synergy + Self-Attention (Post-ConvLSTM) - Aether I | Aether I | 189 | running |\n| 344 | 1 | Policy-only late time injection — std-width nodil (BASE_SEED=123) | Zephyr I | 188 | 85.60 |\n| 343 | 1 | Policy-only late time injection — std-width nodil (BASE_SEED=7) | Zephyr I | 188 | 82.50 |\n| 342 | 1 | Synergy Test: Late Time Injection + PPO Algorithm | Nomos II | 187 | 84.50 |\n| 341 | 1 | Krono II PPO SOTA (Self-Contained Replication - Baseline for Aether I) | Aether I | 187 | 86.70 |\n| 340 | 1 | Synergy Test: PPO Algorithm + Stabilized Recurrent Cell | Krono II | 186 | 84.60 |\n| 339 | 1 | Late time injection to VALUE head only — std-width nodil (BASE_SEED=42) | Zephyr I | 186 | 76.60 |\n| 338 | 1 | Late time injection to POLICY head only — std-width nodil (BASE_SEED=42) | Zephyr I | 186 | 82.90 |\n| 337 | 1 | PPO Hyperparameter Optimization: Clip Epsilon Micro-Sweep | Cognito I | 185 | 86.70 |\n\
    | 336 | 1 | Ablation: remove time input (late-injection arch) — std-width nodil (BASE_SEED=42) | Zephyr I | 185 | 83.50 |\n\nPage 1 of 35 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-35, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n**Read Contents:**\n\n**storage/krono/ppo_reward_shaping.py:**\n```\nimport jax\nimport jax.numpy as jnp\nfrom jax import jit, vmap, lax\nimport flax.linen as nn\nimport optax\nfrom typing import Tuple, Dict, Any\n\n@jit\ndef calculate_gae(\n    rewards: jnp.ndarray, values: jnp.ndarray, dones: jnp.ndarray,\n    gamma: float = 0.97, gae_lambda: float = 0.97, next_values: jnp.ndarray = None,\n) -> jnp.ndarray:\n    assert next_values is not None\n    values_t_plus_1 = jnp.concatenate([values[:, 1:], next_values[:, None]], axis=1)\n    not_done_mask = (1.0 - dones.astype(jnp.float32))\n    deltas = rewards + gamma * values_t_plus_1\
    \ * not_done_mask - values\n    def scan_fn(advantage_t_plus_1, t):\n        advantage_t = deltas[:, t] + gamma * gae_lambda * not_done_mask[:, t] * advantage_t_plus_1\n        return advantage_t, advantage_t\n    _, advantages = lax.scan(\n        scan_fn, jnp.zeros(values.shape[0]), jnp.arange(values.shape[1] - 1, -1, -1),\n    )\n    return advantages[::-1].T\n\ndef ppo_shaped_reward_training_step(\n    network: Any, optimizer: Any, params: Any, opt_state: Any,\n    batch: Dict[str, jnp.ndarray], hparams: Dict[str, Any],\n) -> Tuple[Any, Any]:\n    observations = batch['observations']; actions = batch['actions']\n    rewards = batch['rewards']; dones = batch['dones']\n    old_values = batch['values']; old_log_probs = batch['log_probs']\n    final_values = batch['final_values']; initial_rnn_states = batch.get('initial_rnn_states', None)\n    \n    # --- Reward Shaping ---\n    # Create a mask for rewards that are exactly -1.0 (box pushed off target)\n    mistake_mask = (rewards ==\
    \ -1.0)\n    # Apply an additional penalty to these specific actions\n    shaped_rewards = rewards - mistake_mask * hparams.get('mistake_penalty', 1.0)\n    # This makes the reward for pushing a box off a target -2 instead of -1.\n    \n    advantages = calculate_gae(shaped_rewards, old_values, dones, next_values=final_values)\n    returns = advantages + old_values\n    \n    batch_size, trajectory_length = observations.shape[:2]\n    \n    def loss_fn(params):\n        if initial_rnn_states is not None:\n            def process_env_trajectory(env_idx):\n                env_rnn_state = jax.tree.map(lambda x: jax.lax.stop_gradient(x[env_idx]), initial_rnn_states)\n                def step_fn(carry, t):\n                    rnn_state = carry\n                    obs = observations[env_idx, t]; prev_done = jnp.where(t > 0, dones[env_idx, t-1], False)\n                    logits_b, value_b, new_rnn_state_b = network.apply(params, obs[None, ...], prev_done[None, ...], jax.tree.map(lambda\
    \ x: x[None, ...], rnn_state))\n                    return jax.tree.map(lambda x: x[0], new_rnn_state_b), (logits_b[0], value_b[0])\n                _, (env_logits, env_values) = lax.scan(step_fn, env_rnn_state, jnp.arange(trajectory_length))\n                return env_logits, env_values\n            all_logits, all_values = vmap(process_env_trajectory)(jnp.arange(batch_size))\n        else:\n            obs_r = observations.reshape(batch_size * trajectory_length, *observations.shape[2:])\n            dones_r = dones.reshape(batch_size * trajectory_length)\n            logits_flat, values_flat, _ = network.apply(params, obs_r, dones_r)\n            all_logits = logits_flat.reshape(batch_size, trajectory_length, -1)\n            all_values = values_flat.reshape(batch_size, trajectory_length)\n        \n        log_probs_all = jax.nn.log_softmax(all_logits, axis=-1)\n        new_log_probs = log_probs_all[jnp.arange(batch_size)[:, None], jnp.arange(trajectory_length), actions]\n      \
    \  \n        ratio = jnp.exp(new_log_probs - old_log_probs)\n        advantages_detached = jax.lax.stop_gradient(advantages)\n        policy_loss = -jnp.mean(jnp.minimum(ratio * advantages_detached, jnp.clip(ratio, 1 - hparams['clip_epsilon'], 1 + hparams['clip_epsilon']) * advantages_detached))\n        value_loss = 0.5 * jnp.mean((all_values - jax.lax.stop_gradient(returns)) ** 2)\n        entropy = -jnp.mean(jnp.sum(jax.nn.softmax(all_logits, axis=-1) * log_probs_all, axis=-1))\n        \n        total_loss = policy_loss + hparams['value_loss_coef'] * value_loss - hparams['entropy_coef'] * entropy\n        return total_loss\n    \n    loss, grads = jax.value_and_grad(loss_fn)(params)\n    updates, opt_state = optimizer.update(grads, opt_state, params)\n    params = optax.apply_updates(params, updates)\n    \n    return params, opt_state\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation\
    \ & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
